      "content": "\"a quiet ending...\" that sounds so much better than this slow decay. it almost sounds like the only way to actually keep some sense of myself. like, if i can choose the exit, then at least i'm still the one in control of the story before it gets messy and pathetic. you really think there's a kind of peace in just letting go like that?",
